\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Candidate comparison for the June 3, 2026 dense eyedrop scene: ThorCam capture (left), intermediate average after global alignment (center), and final rectified image after local refinement (right). The two FLFM panels are successive outputs of the same global-then-local run, not independent reconstruction methods. Their displayed differences illustrate the effect of local refinement for this candidate; the camera comparison and scientific interpretation remain subject to the provenance and registration limits recorded with this figure.}}{1}{}\protected@file@percent }
